<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>汽車違規 AI</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f6f8;
            color: #222;
        }

        .app {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: auto;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: white;
        }

        header {
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #d1d5db;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 25px 20px;
        }

        .button {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .camera {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
        }

        .calculator {
            background: #e5e7eb;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .info {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .total {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #ecfdf5;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .total-number {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="app">

    <header>
        <h1>🚗 汽車違規 AI</h1>
        <p>交通違規辨識與罰鍰計算</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content">

        <button class="button camera">
            📷 拍照辨識
        </button>

        <button class="button calculator">
            🧮 手動計算
        </button>

        <div class="info">
            <h2>目前功能</h2>

            <p>✓ 汽車違規辨識</p>
            <p>✓ 違規罰鍰計算</p>
            <p>✓ 多項違規累計</p>
            <p>✓ AI 圖片分析（後續加入）</p>
        </div>

        <div class="total">
            <p>目前預估總額</p>

            <div class="total-number">
                NT$ 0
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
